    "encrypted": "false",
    "long_instructions": "## Create an Image for Your Guide\r\n\r\nYou're going to use an AI image tool to create one image for your responsible AI guide. The AI will ask you two quick questions about your guide, then it will generate an image based on your answers. Give the AI feedback so it can keep refining until you have something you want to use.\r\n\r\nBefore you start, think about:\r\n\r\n- What idea or message from your guide do you want the image to show?\r\n\r\n- Who is your audience?\r\n\r\nWhen you're done,\r\n\r\n1. Save your final image to your **Backpack**.\r\n\r\n2. Complete your Field Notes for this exploration. What assumptions did the AI make? What does that tell you about how image-generation AI behaves in general?",
    "offer_browser_tts": "false",
